  "_about": "The Order clerk at the brazier (Ch6 B03 W06 and B05; speaker `clerk`, CHAR_CLERK), about 38 (M3-CHR-509). Thin, upright, tidy, a functionary: neat close-cropped dark hair, a narrow face with thin lips. The Order's colours without armour: an ivory long-sleeved robe (a high-necked wrap top over an ankle skirt of the same cloth), a still-blue tabard panel to the shin (Sefir's still_blue_silk, act1_npcs.md \u00a75.1), a narrow lacquer-red sash (the Stillguard's red, the office he serves), sandals. No reach-bands: an inland man of the Order. Face sliders relative to the MakeHuman donor (ADR 0021: 1.0 / 0.0 = unchanged). Keys starting with '_' are read by the villager_* modules (villager_hair, villager_costume, villager_textures, write_materials, villager_clips), not by bb_params.",
